  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FF - WWF Myanmar Accelerating Bottom-up Climate Action Through Community Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enhance the resilience of Indigenous communities in Karen State, Myanmar, to the impacts of climate change by creating the enabling conditions needed for the effective implementation of the Kawthoolei Climate Action Plan (KCAP).</narrative>
  </description>
